     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hi Ana,<div><br></div><div>It is not an error, it is a warning.  If you ask for this in the console:</div><div><br></div><div>fit$LM$X</div><div><br></div><div>you will see the design matrix has a few columns of 0s.  These are removed to prevent problems calculating coefficients.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers!</div><div>Mike<br><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
